{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/c5ca139e78f6d076b3ed566558a24cb4.poster.avif?t=1768094106\" width=800 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/c5ca139e78f6d076b3ed566558a24cb4.webm?t=1768094106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/c5ca139e78f6d076b3ed566558a24cb4.mp4?t=1768094106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORBITREL</strong> is a dark new twist on a beloved arcade action classic. Control paddles, flippers, and special abilities as you master focus, finesse, and foresight to unlock five distinct and challenging levels. Beat them all to complete the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Earth survive</strong>? Ponder the theories and ramifications of the global debate that erupts after a mysterious interstellar transmission arrives. Ideas fly back-and-forth exploring the risks and origins of what might be Earth's biggest threat...or opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/63722d97c3d4f300571db2e163394a15.poster.avif?t=1768094106\" width=800 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/63722d97c3d4f300571db2e163394a15.webm?t=1768094106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/63722d97c3d4f300571db2e163394a15.mp4?t=1768094106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smack Attack</strong>! Time your smack perfectly to dominate your opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forcewave</strong>: Charge the ball to destroy defense satellites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flippers</strong>, the newest technology in goal protection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong> balls then launch them, but practice accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>discipline</strong> and <strong>patience</strong> to endure travel to the Oort cloud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a dozen Steam <strong>Achievements</strong>, then pin them to your chest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in an <strong>original atmospheric soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support a lone independent developer locked in a hot dark room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras/405d86c9e3fbb7b46e09f3efffa0f61b.avif?t=1768094106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689570/extras_big/405d86c9e3fbb7b46e09f3efffa0f61b.avif?t=1768094106 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Universe Is Beckoning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689570/f8f841f1e9d2add7c05e6c1e492ee1fb3437329d.jpg"},{"name":"The Universe is Beckoning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689570/43d4a762e4129cf8886f4dcc565e33674b561e34.jpg"},{"name":"Extrasolar Intelligence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689570/2edb625f9655c701604af8c0db9391ffc696097a.jpg"},{"name":"Extrasolar Intelligence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3689570/505eb4ae02cdab